,"id":3385420398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7JyWpu","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-09T11:27:35Z","updated_at":"2025-10-09T11:29:30Z","body":"> The text is hard to read when there is code behind it, I think it needs an outline for contrast, or maybe a background box.\r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"568\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10054226/498960327-174d100e-6f95-42c6-a523-e03559011142.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..rSKpgQAHJui_fVPV50JC-3e5kwtQSK2Kp6WsHxE6AC8\">\r\n> \r\n> It might also look better with each line right-aligned, not sure.\r\n\r\nDidn't really like the right-aligned, makes it harder to read imo.\r\n\r\nThis is my first attempt:\r\n<img width=\"630\" height=\"163\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18b4554d-4963-4d08-a93e-a7999653b4b8\" />\r\n<img width=\"972\" height=\"129\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09f6a709-2599-48ca-8a98-378ae46cdc03\" />\r\n\r\nAdded a semi-transparent stylebox with a border, as well as played with the font color, outline and shadow.\r\nDefinitely more readable, but can still be improved I'm sure.\r\nI don't know if it fits really. Might be too much/distracting?\r\nAlso some weird artifacts in the outline.\r\n\r\nI'll push it now in case someone wants to try it out and suggest tweaks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3385420398/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3464511418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3464511418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3464511418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7OgD-6","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-29T22:26:41Z","updated_at":"2025-10-29T22:26:55Z","body":"> This looks good now, and great improvement IMO!\r\n\r\nThank you! Added all changes.\r\n\r\nThere's still the tiny problem with the white outline where it looks a bit weird, will need to look into that to figure out why it looks like that or if someone else has an idea..","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3464511418/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3470764822","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3470764822","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3470764822,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O36sW","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T00:10:10Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T00:10:10Z","body":"The border outline issue looks like it is an issue with Labels with transparent borders and antialiasing. \r\nThe actual border you added looks too similar to the Label bg, the border properties can just be removed and it should be fixed.\r\n\r\nIt should to be much less transparent, it is still too hard to read when there is text behind it.\r\n\r\nThe Shift modifier only works with Ctrl, so it should say Ctrl+Shift instead.\r\n\r\nYou should be able to use `TTRN` instead of `TTR` to handle the plurals (I think).\r\n\r\nFor the UID/Path can this change automatically based on the setting? It would be useful to know which is UID and which is path.\r\n\r\nWe should probably be as concise as we can here, so it is easy to use as a reference without needing to read too much. \r\nMost of the message is already implied, the user knows its drag and drop since it only shows on drag over, they are already hovering over 'the script', and \"hold %s when dropping\" is the only real action.\r\n\r\nLike:\r\n```\r\nDrop node path.\r\nCtrl: @onready var\r\nAlt: @export var\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nDrop file path.\r\nCtrl: const preload file path\r\nCtrl+Shift: const preload UID path\r\nAlt: @export var\r\n```\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3470764822/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3470870366","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3470870366","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3470870366,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7O4Ude","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-31T00:49:36Z","updated_at":"2025-10-31T00:49:36Z","body":"> The border outline issue looks like it is an issue with Labels with transparent borders and antialiasing. The actual border you added looks too similar to the Label bg, the border properties can just be removed and it should be fixed.\r\n> \r\n> It should to be much less transparent, it is still too hard to read when there is text behind it.\r\n> \r\n\r\nYeah that was it! Just made it completely opaque, seems to be fine now.\r\n\r\nRegarding the other changes they rely on the text change you suggested, which I am personally okay with. But maybe others will think it isn't informative enough? Open to discussion about it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3470870366/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3487796049","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3487796049","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3487796049,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7P44tR","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-04T19:56:26Z","updated_at":"2025-11-04T22:52:32Z","body":"- Updated opacity to be a bit darker, I think its pretty readable now even with a lot of text behind.\r\n- Opted for the single/plural to use TTRN.\r\n- Used inline strings instead of static const.\r\n- Changed wordings a bit to make everything shorter. Maybe there's a way to say that you need to hold the key and not just tap without repeating, and also saying add/insert multiple times. I agree with @kitbdev, I think it should be more on the shorter side since people will see this every time and having a huge text label every time you drag something into the script editor can be a little ugly imo. Every person will think something different about the wordings but I do believe its better to be on the shorter side.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3487796049/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3630514396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3630514396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3630514396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YZUDc","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-09T06:11:42Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T06:37:03Z","body":"just rebased, will try to make some changes today\r\n**EDIT:** added all code suggestions, not any stylebox changes yet","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3630514396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3630713373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3630713373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3630713373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7YaEod","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-09T07:17:58Z","updated_at":"2025-12-09T07:17:58Z","body":"rebased, updated code, made use of default text color and change background to opaque. However, using it on light mode still looks bad because the background is a static color. I tried using the default background color and it looked bad. How would you guys go about doing a dynamic background color based on the theme to account for this? Otherwise I think it looks good.\r\n\r\nAlso, I added an editor setting to hide the info label, again to give an option to avoid unnecessary clutter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3630713373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3857882766","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3857882766","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3857882766,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7l8p6O","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-06T04:25:53Z","updated_at":"2026-02-06T04:25:53Z","body":"> rebased, updated code, made use of default text color and change background to opaque. However, using it on light mode still looks bad because the background is a static color. I tried using the default background color and it looked bad. How would you guys go about doing a dynamic background color based on the theme to account for this? Otherwise I think it looks good.\r\n\r\nYeah, the background color needs to change based on the theme or it doesn't work well on light theme:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"442\" height=\"215\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5fee44bc-0bd1-49a0-875c-ca9aecbe4a68\" />\r\n\r\nI think the completion background color should work here.\r\nThe outline should also use a color from the theme, maybe just the text color.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3857882766/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3884316799","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110796#issuecomment-3884316799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110796","id":3884316799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nhfh_","user":{"login":"fkeyzuwu","id":73611276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjExMjc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73611276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu","html_url":"https://github.com/fkeyzuwu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fkeyzuwu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-11T13:04:04Z","updated_at":"2026-02-11T13:45:01Z","body":"> > rebased, updated code, made use of default text color and change background to opaque. However, using it on light mode still looks bad because the background is a static color. I tried using the default background color and it looked bad. How would you guys go about doing a dynamic background color based on the theme to account for this? Otherwise I think it looks good.\r\n> \r\n> Yeah, the background color needs to change based on the theme or it doesn't work well on light theme:\r\n> <img alt=\"image\" width=\"442\" height=\"215\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/10054226/545990904-5fee44bc-0bd1-49a0-875c-ca9aecbe4a68.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..3XrEvk9QMx